# Conformance probe pack for spec 0.94: plain members, the entities the other packs are encoded from. Public.
format     conformance-held-src
version    0.94.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       json
field   uid         id   string
field   lat         lat  float
field   probe.n     n    int
field   probe.x     x    int
field   probe.y     y    int  absent 99
field   probe.z     z    int
field   probe.w     w    int
field   probe.c1    c1   int
field   probe.s1    s    string
group   probe.recs  recs
  field  probe.x  x  int
  field  probe.y  y  int
end
